 <br/><a name='toc_1'></a>
<h1 class='doclevel'>1.Test Suite : gdir3527_BBT</h1>
<div><p>Se testeaza adaugarea unui produs</p>
</div><a name="toc_tc28613"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P233-52: AdaugareProdusValidECP&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">gmir3531</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>verifica ca un produs valid este adaugat corect in lista de produse</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>sistemul este initializat si nu exista un produs cu id-ul testat in lista de produse</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>se completeaza campurile: id=1, nume=&quot;Cafea&quot;, pret=10,&nbsp;se aleg categorie si tip si se apasa butonul de adaugare</p>
</td><td><p>produsul este adaugat in lista si nu apare nicio eroare</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceTest</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceTest#addProduct_ValidProduct1</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">gdir3527_F01:  AdaugareProdus [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc28616"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P233-53: AdaugareProdusInvalidECP&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">gmir3531</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>verifica ca un produs cu id invalid nu este adaugat in lista de produse</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>sistemul este initializat</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>se completeaza campurile cu id=0, nume=&quot;Cafea&quot;, pret=10, se selecteaza categorie si tip si se apasa butonul de adaugare</p>
